/target
Cargo.lock.bak
*.swp
.DS_Store
.claude/

# Tauri ACL artifacts, decided rather than defaulted.
#
# COMMITTED, on purpose:
#   crates/pelican-shell/gen/schemas/capabilities.json
#   crates/pelican-shell/permissions/autogenerated/*.toml
# These are the *granted* surface: which commands the webview may invoke.
# A change that widens it should be as visible in review as a new dependency.
#
# IGNORED: regenerable, large, and about upstream rather than us:
# Tauri core's own permission catalog and editor autocomplete schemas,
# all rebuilt by build.rs.
crates/pelican-shell/gen/schemas/acl-manifests.json
crates/pelican-shell/gen/schemas/*-schema.json

# Impeccable working artifacts.
# Kept: surfaces/ (the direction contract), config.json, direction-payload.json,
# and archive/fjord/ (the retired Fjord comps, build state and design.json --
# history only; nothing there is an approved comp for the current window).
# Ignored: everything regenerable from those by re-running the scripts.
.impeccable/review/
.impeccable/questions/
.impeccable/build/scaffold/
.impeccable/build/comp-grid.png

# Local Flatpak builds (packaging/flatpak/README.md).
/build-flatpak/
/.flatpak-builder/
/repo-flatpak/
